      r17_improvement_push:
        level: stark
        description: Improvements to MAS will be made available to the user via generic-init
          PUSH_IMPROVEMENTS
        details:
        - NACH JEDEM FULL_IMPROVEMENT oder REVIEW: null
        - '  → CHECK: user_workspace = {workspace} (aus Call-parameterssssn, not .mas-mode)'
        - '  → IF user_workspace exists + {workspace}/00-GUIDELINES.md exists + generic-init
