        level: extreme
        description: NEVER do it yourself — delegate to sub-agents (R16 + verschaerft)
        details:
        - 'VOR each shell/write/edit: CHECK ob a Sub-agent exists'
        - 'IF Sub-agent exists: delegate() INSTEAD OF doing it yourself'
